-- title:
--   Exact residual coefficient polynomial C2
-- statement:
--   The bundle specifies an explicit vector of 63 rational real coefficients $c_i$, indexed by $0\le i<63$, and the complex polynomial
--
--   $$C_{2}(t)=\sum_{i=0}^{62}c_i t^i\qquad(t\in\mathbb C).$$
--
--   The complete coefficient table is part of the formal definition. This is residual coefficient data for the validated ninth-row inverse; its degree is at most 62.
